reference.api:
```
POST /v1/auth/session       {credential}                  → {session, eligibility_token (single use)}
POST /v1/ballots            {election_id, ciphertext, proofs, eligibility_token}
                            → 201 {receipt_id, ballot_hash, bulletin_seq}     (409 if token already used)
GET  /v1/bulletin?from=seq  → public, append-only list of {seq, ballot_hash, prev_hash}
GET  /v1/receipts/{id}      → inclusion proof (Merkle path) for the voter's own ballot
POST /admin/tally           (needs k of n trustee key shares)
GET  /v1/results            → counts + decryption/shuffle proofs
```
